d ","aاشعل الإِبِلَ","^","t(assumed tropical:) ","eHe dispersed the camels.","t (Lh, K, (TA.) ","s6","t-b6- And ","aاشعل السَّقْىَ","^","t(assumed tropical:) ","eHe made","t [","ethe water-ing","t or] ","ethe water","t [","eof the irrigation","t] ","eabundant.","t (IAar, K, TA.) ","s2","t-A2- ","aأَشْعَلَتِ الغَارَةُ","^","t(assumed tropical:) ","eThe horsemen making a hostile,","t or ","epredatory, incursion became dispersed,","t or ","edispersed themselves.","t (S, K.) ","s2","t-b2- ","aاشعلت الطَّعْنَةُ","^","t(assumed tropical:) ","eThe spear-wound,","t or ","ethe like, emitted its blood in a scattered state.","t (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K.) And ","aاشعلت القِرْبَةُ","t, and ","aالمَزَادَةُ","t, ","^","t(assumed tropical:) ","eThe water-skin,","t and ","ethe leathern water-bag, shed its water in a scattered state.","t (S, K.) And ","aاشعلت العَيْنُ","^","t(assumed tropical:) ","eThe eye shed its tears copiously.","t (O, K.) ","s3","t-b3- See also 1, last sentence. "]},{"headword":"تَشَعَّلَ","page":1563,"tokens":["t5 ","aتَشَعَّلَ","t see what next follows. "]},{"headword":"اشتعلت النَّارُ","page":1563,"tokens":["t8 ","aاشتعلت النَّارُ","aذ","t; (Lh, S, O, Msb, K, TA;) and ","aشَعَلَت","t, aor. ","aشَعَلَ","t; (Msb;) and [in an intensive sense] ","aتشعّلت","t; (K, TA;) ","eThe fire became kindled;","t or ","eit burned up, burned brightly","t or ","efiercely, blazed,","t or ","eflamed;","t syn. ","aتَأَجَّجَت","t, (Lh, TA,) or ","aاِضْطَرَمَت","t, (S, O, TA,) or ","aتَوَقَّدَت","t, (Msb,) and ","aاِلْتَهَبَت","t; (K, * TA;) ","aفِى الحَطَبِ","t [","ein the firewood","t]. (Lh, TA.) ","s2","t-b2- Hence, ","aاِشْتَعَلَ غَضَبًا","^","t(tropical:) ","eHe became excited,","t or ","einflamed, with anger:","t (TA:) or ","ehe became filled with wrath.","t (Msb.) ","s3","t-b3- Hence also, ","aاشتعل الشَّيْبُ فِى الرَّأْسِ","^","t(tropical:) ","eWhiteness of the hair became glistening in the head;","t including the hair of the beard. (TA.) And ","aاشتعل الرَّأْسَ شَيْبًا","t [in the